      "side": 1,
      "message": "The mapping is 1:1, but IMO the names don\u0027t convey that well what is happening, so I had to focus hard when trying to map the values.\n\nRust docs can be found here: https://docs.rs/png/latest/png/enum.DisposeOp.html\nSkia definitions/comments can be found here: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/skia/include/codec/SkCodecAnimation.h\n\n* Mapping `DisposeOp::None`\n    * `DisposeOp:None`: Leave the buffer unchanged.\n    * `SkCodecAnimation::DisposalMethod::kKeep`: The next frame should be drawn on top of this one.\n* Mapping `DisposeOp::Background`\n    * `DisposeOp::Background`: Clear buffer with the background color.\n    * `SkCodecAnimation::DisposalMethod::kRestoreBGColor`: Similar to Keep, except the area inside this frame\u0027s rectangle should be cleared to the BackGround color (transparent) before drawing the next frame.\n* Mapping `DisposeOp::Previous`:\n    * `DisposeOp::Previous`: Reset the buffer to the state before the current frame.\n    * `SkCodecAnimation::DisposalMethod::kRestorePrevious`: The next frame should be drawn on top of the previous frame - i.e. disregarding this one.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 73,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 73,
        "endChar": 1
      },
